---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="staples" title="A pilot: bulk staples" lede="The same round, for a single product in a fixed pack, delivered once to the gate.">
  <div class="split">
    <div class="packs" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="surface pack card-hover"><strong>Rice</strong><span>25 kg</span></div>
      <div class="surface pack card-hover"><strong>Oil</strong><span>15 L</span></div>
      <div class="surface pack card-hover"><strong>Atta</strong><span>10 kg</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 56ch">
      If ten flats want the same pack in the same week, a wholesaler delivers once and everyone pays less. No baskets, no fresh produce, no delivery slots: one product, one pack, one drop. We are testing whether staples rounds fill the way service rounds do.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
